OL,3,ATrump says Canada wants 'benefits' of
OL,4,Abeing US state after trade talks
OL,5,Acollapse
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS President Donald Trump has said
OL,8,FCanada wants "the benefits of being a
OL,9,FState, without being one" after trade
OL,10,Ftalks between the two countries
OL,11,Fcollapsed late on Friday.
OL,13,FIn his first comments since
OL,14,Fnegotiations broke down, triggering new
OL,15,F50% US tariffs on a range of Canadian
OL,16,Fgoods, Trump also said American farmers
OL,17,Fhad been charged "massive amounts of
OL,18,FTariffs" for years.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
